  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>更好的烽火台基座放置是一個簡約且可設定的模組，讓玩家能透過手持礦物方塊對烽火台按右鍵，輕鬆放置基座方塊。潛行/蹲下+右鍵則可一次放置手中整組方塊。破壞烽火台時，也會連帶破壞所有基座方塊，並將它們掉落於烽火台的位置。被取代的方塊則會掉落在烽火台頂端。<br><br></p>\n<p><em>基岩不會被取代。</em><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>您可能也會對<span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-conduit-placement\">更好的海靈核心放置</a></span>感興趣。</strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細資訊</summary>\n<p><span><strong>breakBeaconBaseBlocks</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，破壞烽火台時會掉落所有基座方塊。<br><br><span><strong>dropReplacedBlockTopBeacon</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，當礦物方塊取代一般方塊時，被取代的方塊會掉落在烽火台頂端。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以手持礦物方塊對烽火台按右鍵，它會放置在接下來的基座位置：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細資訊</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/better-beacon-placement/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"844\" height=\"424\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><br><span><strong>你也可以潛行+右鍵來一次放置整組礦物方塊：</strong><br></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細資訊</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/better-beacon-placement/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"840\" height=\"424\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><br><span><strong>可設定讓被取代的方塊掉落在烽火台頂端：</strong><br></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細資訊</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/better-beacon-placement/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"844\" height=\"426\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><br><span><strong>破壞烽火台方塊時也會同時破壞所有基座方塊：</strong><br></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細資訊</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/better-beacon-placement/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，你可自由在任何模組包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概述與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
